  "project_description": "Search API / Views integration for Arch Stock. It exposes a boolean 'has stock' Views filter (arch_stock_has_stock_search_api) on a Search API 'products' index, so a product listing can hide out-of-stock items. The filter is warehouse-aware: it only considers the warehouses the current user is permitted to purchase from, matching the access model of arch_stock.",
